    "body": "**Is your feature request related to privacy?**\r\nYes\r\n\r\n**Is there a patch available for this feature somewhere?**\r\nYes, it's an edit request\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nMozilla partenered with Cloudflare for their DoH resolver and they have a resolver (https://mozilla.cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query) which limits logged data and data retention, opposed to the 1.1.1.1\r\nCan it be used instead the current 1.1.1.1 if DoH flag value is set to Cloudflare?\r\n\r\n[Source article](https://www.ghacks.net/2018/04/02/configure-dns-over-https-in-firefox/)\r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\r\nany\r\n",
